# Migrate Database to MongoDB

1. Review current database schema and operations for migration readiness
2. Update Prisma schema to match new MongoDB data model
3. Configure MongoDB connection settings in codebase
4. Perform initial data import from PostgreSQL using a migration tool
5. Test application with migrated data in isolated environment
